<title>UK: Uneventful London precious metals close lower.</title>
<headline>Uneventful London precious metals close lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closes at $341.30/341.80, off $1.10 from Thursday. Very quiet, tightly range bound.</p>
<p>SILVER - Similar to gold. Ends down three cents at $4.72/4.74.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Closes off $3.00 at $437.00/442.00. Easing gently amid very light volumes.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Finishes down $6 at $202.00/207.00.</p>
</text>
